                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "substance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81e3ffca-5ed3-3634-873d-3baa2c803e86",
                                        "entry_id": "b894fb25-f0f7-342f-8eeb-ce9801fb88a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Physical matter; material."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "049d75ac-cb0f-4fe2-8777-3d56ebf7efff",
                                                "sense_id": "81e3ffca-5ed3-3634-873d-3baa2c803e86",
                                                "text": "Study gives strength to the mind; conversation, grace: the first apt to give stiffness, the other suppleness: one gives substance and form to the statue, the other polishes it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85093227-6b1e-49d8-a340-65aa84fdbca1",
                                                "sense_id": "81e3ffca-5ed3-3634-873d-3baa2c803e86",
                                                "text": "His wasted hands were stretched out, and worked with a quick and convulsive motion, as if catching some small substances which kept eluding their grasp;..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ace21748-34c6-499f-a7f0-8b13e758e962",
                                                "sense_id": "81e3ffca-5ed3-3634-873d-3baa2c803e86",
                                                "text": "Plastics are energy-rich substances, which is why many of them burn so readily. Any organism that could unlock and use that energy would do well in the Anthropocene. Terrestrial bacteria and fungi which can manage this trick are already familiar to experts in the field."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2b0e67f-1a10-386c-b42f-d2759ade87cf",
                                        "entry_id": "b894fb25-f0f7-342f-8eeb-ce9801fb88a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Physical matter; material.",
                                            "A form of matter that has constant chemical composition and characteristic properties."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57c19de6-2b6d-33f7-859d-91143dc1b73c",
                                        "entry_id": "b894fb25-f0f7-342f-8eeb-ce9801fb88a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The essential part of anything; the most vital part."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af920da5-3d14-4ac5-b58c-d05631817547",
                                                "sense_id": "57c19de6-2b6d-33f7-859d-91143dc1b73c",
                                                "text": "Heroic virtue did his actions guide, / And he the substance, not the appearance, chose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d80ef5bb-ad4e-49f2-a1f4-5f8332b7899b",
                                                "sense_id": "57c19de6-2b6d-33f7-859d-91143dc1b73c",
                                                "text": "1684-1690, Thomas Burnet, Sacred Theory of the Earth\nThis edition is the same in substance with the Latin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94a71032-b3fd-43ce-8c01-e0e6607fa2d1",
                                                "sense_id": "57c19de6-2b6d-33f7-859d-91143dc1b73c",
                                                "text": "It is insolent in words, in manner; but in substance it is not only insulting, but alarming."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "022c1f61-37cf-3cdc-8d79-33addfbef79a",
                                        "entry_id": "b894fb25-f0f7-342f-8eeb-ce9801fb88a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Substantiality; solidity; firmness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89e2071f-ffe2-412b-a221-92bea188b354",
                                                "sense_id": "022c1f61-37cf-3cdc-8d79-33addfbef79a",
                                                "text": "Some textile fabrics have little substance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f2ff5c1-db90-30b8-bbf8-ce6822b7bf6d",
                                        "entry_id": "b894fb25-f0f7-342f-8eeb-ce9801fb88a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Material possessions; estate; property; resources."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f7564f1-e435-4023-9648-7ce777261caf",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2ff5c1-db90-30b8-bbf8-ce6822b7bf6d",
                                                "text": "a man of substance"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ca03204-6ddd-488c-8fc7-555d6cd12d47",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2ff5c1-db90-30b8-bbf8-ce6822b7bf6d",
                                                "text": "And there wasted his substance with riotous living."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97880470-21e8-498b-93b8-d15a7580db3e",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2ff5c1-db90-30b8-bbf8-ce6822b7bf6d",
                                                "text": "Thy substance, valued at the highest rate, / Cannot amount unto a hundred marks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa2880a1-0e66-43b2-82af-2373ebe74691",
                                                "sense_id": "3f2ff5c1-db90-30b8-bbf8-ce6822b7bf6d",
                                                "text": "And as we have waſted our Strength and vital Subſtance in this profuſe manner, ſo we have ſhamefully miſapplied it to Ends at leaſt very different from thoſe for which we undertook the War, and often to effect others which after a Peace we may ſeverely repent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "327bbf96-5468-34d6-bd91-2b99a50b9daa",
                                        "entry_id": "b894fb25-f0f7-342f-8eeb-ce9801fb88a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Drugs (illegal narcotics)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f36f8e11-ec4a-4b4b-9528-92bc982070d2",
                                                "sense_id": "327bbf96-5468-34d6-bd91-2b99a50b9daa",
                                                "text": "substance abuse"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c5d5981-62a8-3ba1-b11c-9a414b31827b",
                                        "entry_id": "b894fb25-f0f7-342f-8eeb-ce9801fb88a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ousia, essence; underlying reality or hypostasis in the philosophical sense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "substance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29262bf2-2ef5-3c1c-b193-25f36544877c",
                                        "entry_id": "9149bd69-95d3-3c11-93e6-85e66b0d63ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To give substance to; to make real or substantial."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39451e03-5af6-4fd1-a089-02ab3197c26e",
                                                "sense_id": "29262bf2-2ef5-3c1c-b193-25f36544877c",
                                                "text": "If life were nothing but what gets phrased and substanced, the world might as well be rolled up and laid away again in darkness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "866b8a04-7b02-4ab0-9c7e-60b28aae9344",
                                                "sense_id": "29262bf2-2ef5-3c1c-b193-25f36544877c",
                                                "text": "The calm ruminating / Reverie, substancing / Intellect into emotion, / Is shelter enough for love / Unhumiliated by faith."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2fb20f6f-79f4-4601-99c0-d8bd08843853",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a88133d-8a52-337a-9d67-403138f70e2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1115e4d0-15d9-34a5-9a67-129c77043167",
                        "source_sense_description": "stof (stoffen)",
                        "target_lang_word": "substance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "substance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2696e456-fab2-3ea6-a88d-d1c45f443c35",
                                        "entry_id": "679c6ef7-1bd8-32ea-9fe0-d18a6b049cff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui subsiste par soi-même, indépendamment de tout accident."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "517da68f-617c-4f31-bcb1-ec899342f000",
                                                "sense_id": "2696e456-fab2-3ea6-a88d-d1c45f443c35",
                                                "text": "Je lui apprendrai, dit le docteur, les huit parties d’oraison, la dialectique, l’astrologie, la démonomanie, ce que c’est que la substance et l’accident, l’abstrait et le concret, les monades et l’harmonie préétablie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a23c97a3-b8f3-477b-b71d-d3bbd76235d9",
                                                "sense_id": "2696e456-fab2-3ea6-a88d-d1c45f443c35",
                                                "text": "Descartes a donné trois démonstrations de l’existence de Dieu. nᵒ 1 J’ai en moi l’idée de Dieu. Par le nom de Dieu, j’entends une substance infinie, éternelle, immuable, indépendante, toute-connaissante et toute-puissante."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f7a78d4-ef96-40a1-be3a-11c45f977bb1",
                                                "sense_id": "2696e456-fab2-3ea6-a88d-d1c45f443c35",
                                                "text": "D’après Spinoza, il n’existe qu’une substance unique, dont tous les êtres sont des modes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08303e1d-c9eb-3b67-a14d-1e1d334895c6",
                                        "entry_id": "679c6ef7-1bd8-32ea-9fe0-d18a6b049cff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Toute sorte de matière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f41b2bde-5ca6-44a4-8852-3e8afccfa966",
                                                "sense_id": "08303e1d-c9eb-3b67-a14d-1e1d334895c6",
                                                "text": "Au niveau du siège du dépôt tuberculeux, le périoste se détache de l’os , s’injecte , s’enflamme et fournit de l’exsudation plastique , qui peut s’organiser en substance osseuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "986020a2-68ce-43c5-b496-93f8182f2ac7",
                                                "sense_id": "08303e1d-c9eb-3b67-a14d-1e1d334895c6",
                                                "text": "Les poils de chèvre diffèrent de la laine du mouton par des cellules de surface externe qui sont un peu moins ou peu saillantes et par des stries de leur substance propre qui, au contraire, sont très apparentes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a947f39d-1875-4ee9-bc7d-0d36802dacab",
                                                "sense_id": "08303e1d-c9eb-3b67-a14d-1e1d334895c6",
                                                "text": "Celui qui veut vendre un cheval atteint d’épilepsie n’en peut pas dissimuler les accès à son gré à moins qu’il ne puisse les retarder ou les modérer par la vertu de substances médicamenteuses : le bromure de potassium par exemple."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12cfc336-1c0a-4c25-97c5-e7d422c2b2a0",
                                                "sense_id": "08303e1d-c9eb-3b67-a14d-1e1d334895c6",
                                                "text": "Au cœur de la mêlée, l’un des joueurs surgit, accroché contre sa monture dressée à la verticale et, par-dessus la crinière, il brandissait la carcasse du bouc, déjà vidée à moitié de sang et de substance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b079f31f-a7ab-3bfe-9c12-521ef00a53c9",
                                        "entry_id": "679c6ef7-1bd8-32ea-9fe0-d18a6b049cff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qu’il y a de meilleur, de plus succulent, de plus nourrissant en quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0567409-d6ef-4b7b-8d6b-bac59dd921a7",
                                                "sense_id": "b079f31f-a7ab-3bfe-9c12-521ef00a53c9",
                                                "text": "Les arbres, les plantes attirent la substance de la terre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89bf6d50-4ed8-4afb-be2d-7fdaad2a4dca",
                                                "sense_id": "b079f31f-a7ab-3bfe-9c12-521ef00a53c9",
                                                "text": "Il n’y a guère de substance dans ces sortes d’aliments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a747eec-99c1-460d-b78c-37f0caa0e3df",
                                                "sense_id": "b079f31f-a7ab-3bfe-9c12-521ef00a53c9",
                                                "text": "Le bouillon a pris toute la substance de cette viande."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3622c1b4-3f34-3e77-8d9f-6b2dd2fefa63",
                                        "entry_id": "679c6ef7-1bd8-32ea-9fe0-d18a6b049cff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qu’il y a d’essentiel dans un discours, dans un écrit, dans une affaire, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1249303-22c2-4f77-9620-a6ec0038e2ac",
                                                "sense_id": "3622c1b4-3f34-3e77-8d9f-6b2dd2fefa63",
                                                "text": "(Acte notarié). La preuve testimoniale n'est pas admissible contre les énonciations d'un acte notarié relatives à sa substance , aux dispositions qu'il contient, aux formes et solennités qu'il constate avoir été observées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66960b38-c1aa-4b7c-a435-78551520beca",
                                                "sense_id": "3622c1b4-3f34-3e77-8d9f-6b2dd2fefa63",
                                                "text": "Certains « on dit » circulent, s’amplifient, se font écho à eux-mêmes indéfiniment, sans avoir cependant de substance réelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ef0abc7-0c7d-4933-9a9a-31a0d46cb323",
                                                "sense_id": "3622c1b4-3f34-3e77-8d9f-6b2dd2fefa63",
                                                "text": "Il y a beaucoup de paroles et peu de substance dans ce discours, dans ce livre : Il y a beaucoup de verbiage et peu d’idées.\n— Je n’ai pu retenir tout ce qu’il a dit, mais je vous en rapporterai, je vous en dirai la substance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ac11429-e3f2-40c8-bbca-5a2679932b74",
                                                "sense_id": "3622c1b4-3f34-3e77-8d9f-6b2dd2fefa63",
                                                "text": "Par conséquent, même dans les rares cas où l’approbation de la cour FISA est nécessaire pour cibler les communications d’un individu, la procédure ressemble plus à une pantomime dénuée de substance qu’à un contrôle véritablement significatif qui s’exercerait sur la NSA."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
